   "line": [
    "Nc7"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight tucks back to c7, ready to reroute through e6 to contest the center — and our pawn on c5 discourages White from playing d4.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "...Nc7-e6 and the c5 restraint"
